     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);border:none;line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">I’m hosting <a href=\"http://forum.mozillascience.org/t/research-coding-q-a-march-24-2015-3-pm-pdt/214\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://forum.mozillascience.org/t/research-coding-q-a-march-24-2015-3-pm-pdt/214&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468341972000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a3eNJgXdmssmLKGtgapRB\">an online Q &amp; A session</a> with the Mozilla Science Lab and a bunch of people who run groups like D-RUG. Our hope is to exchange best practices amongst these groups and provide some guidance for new ones starting up. Hopefully we’ll learn some things to make D-RUG better.  It might also be of interest to the alums on the list who have left Davis and are doing related work elsewhere.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">It’ll be on <strong>Tues, 3/24 at 3PM PDT on <a href=\"http://forum.mozillascience.org/t/research-coding-q-a-march-24-2015-3-pm-pdt/214\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://forum.mozillascience.org/t/research-coding-q-a-march-24-2015-3-pm-pdt/214&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468341972000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a3eNJgXdmssmLKGtgapRB\">the MSL forum</a></strong>. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Best,</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SGkgYWxsLDxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+SSdtIGhvc3RpbmcgW2FuIG9ubGluZSBRICZhbXA7\r\nIEEgc2Vzc2lvbl0oaHR0cDovL2ZvcnVtLm1vemlsbGFzY2llbmNlLm9yZy90L3Jlc2VhcmNoLWNv\r\nZGluZy1xLWEtbWFyY2gtMjQtMjAxNS0zLXBtLXBkdC8yMTQpIHdpdGggdGhlIE1vemlsbGEgU2Np\r\nZW5jZSBMYWIgYW5kIGEgYnVuY2ggb2YgcGVvcGxlIHdobyBydW4gZ3JvdXBzIGxpa2UgRC1SVUcu\r\nIE91ciBob3BlIGlzIHRvIGV4Y2hhbm